# Workout Tracker App

A full-stack workout tracking application. **Work in progress.**

## Tech Stack

**Backend**
- Python / FastAPI
- SQLAlchemy + SQLite
- JWT authentication (python-jose)
- bcrypt password hashing

**Frontend**
- React + Vite
- React Router
- Zustand (global state)
- Axios (API calls)
- Recharts (progress charts — planned)

## Status
**Current Status**
 User registration and login / DONE
 JWT authentication / DONE
 Protected routes / DONE
 Workout logging endpoint / DONE
 Workout logging form (frontend) / WIP
 Dashboard with workout history / WIP
 Progress charts / WIP

